{
  "slug": "filestack-claude-plugin",
  "name": "Filestack Claude Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Filestack is a file handling platform-as-a-service used by thousands of applications for uploads, cloud source ingestion (Google Drive, Dropbox, Instagram, and 14 more), on-the-fly image/video/document processing via CDN, and policy-based security. This plugin brings the full Filestack platform into Claude Code through 10 MCP tools (upload, retrieve, delete, store URL, build and apply CDN transformations, list available transforms, generate security policies, sign policies, generate signed URLs), 3 context-aware skills (SDK integration guidance, API error diagnosis, and webhook signature verification setup), and a natural language /filestack-transform slash command that converts plain English into Filestack CDN transformation URLs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `filestack-error-diagnosis` (Use when user encounters Filestack API errors), `filestack-intelligence` (Use when the user wants to analyze a file's content with AI/ML — content tagging, NSFW detection, OCR,…), `filestack-sdk-integration` (Use when the user is working with Filestack SDK or API), `filestack-webhook-setup` (Use when user is setting up Filestack webhook endpoints), `filestack-workflow-design` (Use when the user wants to design, run, or troubleshoot a Filestack Workflow — a multi-step file processing…)\n- **Commands** (1): `filestack-transform` (Build a Filestack CDN transformation URL from a file handle and a plain-English description)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `filestack`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install filestack-claude-plugin@claude-community` from `filestack/filestack-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
